  "refinements": [
    "Affirmative architecture recommendation for a genuine Scheme-to-Zig native backend and shared system-service carrier; semantic plausibility differs from full native target admission and positive economics",
    "Gambit target dump/primitive/frame/register interfaces support a backend seam while Scheme completion must extract late C resource/control/boxing semantics before rendering",
    "TailHostProfile and explicit DispatchHostProfile are separate whole-cohort module/frame/control designs, not silent fallback; arbitrary C nonlocal transfers across Zig frames remain excluded",
    "Zig source generation and an independent high-level MLIR/LLVM provider can share runtime contracts without serializing through Zig source or internal Zig compiler LLVM APIs",
    "Actual ordered span summaries distinguish net cursor change, write high-water, formed-address high-water and minima; guarded excess above trigger differs from relative-to-entry work",
    "Logical grant permission and underlying native allocation provenance are distinct; integer-only checked probes need separate rules and pointer formation cannot rely only on absence of body writes",
    "Conditional source cases include ordinary 64-bit no-handles pair 3 words, allocated box 2 words and fixed vector n+1+2*d; isolated dynamic small extent <=255 is not a universal whole-program B",
    "Dirty cache versions and actual boxes occur before or after checks; current counter reset cannot erase pending emitted constructors or materialization events",
    "Dynamic tentative hp, body completion, helper rebase/requested GC and post-return bindings have separate assurances; local finish work before complete-frame GC needs actual contiguous capacity or qualified staging",
    "Conditional independent-maxima rest/key finish arithmetic of 25601 words before extras is neither a demonstrated reachable state nor a native overflow witness",
    "Immutable code-bound AllocationPlan/LayoutRecipe and runtime ActualSpanBinding/completion/root publication have distinct authority; compact dense runs and explicit sparse/partial exceptions retain actual writers/users",
    "Ten matched support rows, six maintenance events and five net conditions credit generated modern C/C-ZT and shared LLVM value before an unproved Zig increment",
    "Three registered views changed after study entry; entry and observed hashes are recorded separately without modifying, executing or adopting their producer/model/native evidence"
